Package: metacor
Type: Package
Title: Meta-Analytic Effect Size Calculation for Pre-Post Designs with Correlation Imputation
Version: 1.1.0
Author: Iker J. Bautista [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Iker J. Bautista <ikerugr@gmail.com>
Description: Tools for the calculation of effect sizes (SMD, mean difference) in pre-post controlled studies, including robust imputation of missing variances and correlations.
    The main function 'metacor_dual' implements several methods for imputing missing SDdiff or correlation coefficients,
    and generates transparent imputation reports. Designed for meta-analyses with incomplete summary statistics.
